# Implementation Plan — Smart Attendance System Frontend

Design and develop a premium, animated frontend for the Smart Attendance System, integrating with the existing Flask backend.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Hosting & Integration**: I will create the frontend in a `frontend/` directory. For deployment, I recommend hosting the frontend on Netlify (for speed and modern features) and the Flask backend separately (or as Netlify functions if we refactor). For local development, they will run on different ports (3000 and 5000), and I'll configure a proxy or CORS.

> [!NOTE]
> **Face Recognition**: The "Attendance Marking" interface will use `react-webcam` to capture frames and send them to the `/attendance/mark` endpoint in real-time or on-demand.

## Proposed Changes

### Frontend Infrastructure
- **Framework**: Next.js 14+ (App Router) with TypeScript.
- **Styling**: Tailwind CSS + Shadcn UI primitives for a premium feel.
- **Animations**: Framer Motion for page transitions and micro-interactions.
- **Data Viz**: Recharts for dashboard analytics.

